---
/** 吸顶顶栏：品牌、导航、搜索/主题按钮；移动端折叠为抽屉 */
import { SITE } from "../site.config";

const path = Astro.url.pathname;
const isActive = (href: string) =>
  href === "/" ? path === "/" : path.startsWith(href);
---

<header class="topbar">
  <div class="page topbar-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      <span class="brand-name">{SITE.name}</span>
      <span class="brand-en">{SITE.nameEn}</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="topbar-nav" data-topnav aria-label="主导航">
      {SITE.nav.map((item) => (
        <a href={item.href} aria-current={isActive(item.href) ? "page" : undefined}>
          {item.label}
        </a>
      ))}
    </nav>

    <button class="icon-btn" data-open-search aria-label="搜索（⌘K）" title="搜索 ⌘K">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle>
        <path d="m20 20-3.5-3.5"></path>
      </svg>
    </button>

    <button class="icon-btn" data-toggle-theme aria-label="切换明暗主题" title="切换主题">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.5"></circle>
        <path d="M12 2.5v2M12 19.5v2M2.5 12h2M19.5 12h2M5 5l1.4 1.4M17.6 17.6 19 19M19 5l-1.4 1.4M6.4 17.6 5 19"></path>
      </svg>
    </button>

    <button class="icon-btn menu-btn" data-menu-btn aria-label="打开菜单" aria-expanded="false">
      <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M4 7h16M4 12h16M4 17h16"></path>
      </svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>
